            <ArticleTitle>[Molecular mechanisms of the development of cardiovascular pathology].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>572-4</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Changes of a number of functions of beta-receptor complex mechanism have been analyzed by means of the microwave-dielectrometry method on native erythrocytes at various stages of cardiovascular pathology. The control scheme of beta-receptor complex has been analyzed in the adenylate cyclase system and the regions have been extracted which are subjected to an attack of pathological factors of the effect.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
